{"id":"18ca772ab524a46f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-commutator.md","title":"Commutator","display":"df-commutator — Commutator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-commutator","aliases":["93-df-commutator"],"display":"df-commutator — Commutator","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-polynomial]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-commutator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-commutator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-commutator — Commutator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi,\\delta\">\\(\\theta,\\psi,\\delta\\)</span> are congruence candidates.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>. For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)\\)</span> says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m+n)\">\\((m+n)\\)</span>-ary polynomial operation as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\)</span> is the term-condition centrality predicate defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>交换子函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 保留其候选对象上的谓词定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi,\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar a&#39;\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\;\\forall\\bar b,\\bar b&#39;\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar a&#39;(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(\\langle\\bar b(j),\\bar b&#39;(j)\\rangle\\in\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\langle p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b),p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\delta\n\\to\\langle p(\\bar a&#39;{}^\\frown\\bar b),p(\\bar a&#39;{}^\\frown\\bar b&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi,\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar a&#39;\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\;\\forall\\bar b,\\bar b&#39;\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar a&#39;(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(\\langle\\bar b(j),\\bar b&#39;(j)\\rangle\\in\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\langle p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b),p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\delta\n\\to\\langle p(\\bar a&#39;{}^\\frown\\bar b),p(\\bar a&#39;{}^\\frown\\bar b&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\n\\land[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\n\\land[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The similarity type used by the polynomial operations is quantified inside the centrality predicate and recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>. The top congruence belongs to the defining family; in a congruence-modular variety the intersection is the standard commutator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]. For $m,n\\in\\omega$, $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)$ says that $p$ is an $(m+n)$-ary polynomial operation as in [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]. For $m,n\\in\\omega$, $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)$ says that $p$ is an $(m+n)$-ary polynomial operation as in [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\psi,\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"(m+n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\\mathrm{TC}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(\\theta,\\psi;\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi,\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar a'\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\;\\forall\\bar b,\\bar b'\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,m+n;\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\land\n\\forall i<m\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar a'(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\land\\forall j<n\\;(\\langle\\bar b(j),\\bar b'(j)\\rangle\\in\\psi)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\langle p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b),p(\\bar a{}^\\frown\\bar b')\\rangle\\in\\delta\n\\to\\langle p(\\bar a'{